</figure><figure><img alt=\"第27屆動漫節7月24日開鑼，氣氛熾熱。（梁鵬威攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260724/1157388413574713344387914.jpeg/aslP--7_-Y06LQObFRRgl4viCfbsjY7UheNJl6DjSZc\"/><figcaption>第27屆動漫節7月24日開鑼，氣氛熾熱。（梁鵬威攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-24T12:40:22.614761+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1357,"images":22,"source":"HK01 社會","fallback":"none"}}